{"articleNo":"564205","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=564205&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] [장애학생 권역별 선도대학 사업] 장애대학생 체력증진 프로그램 신청 안내","writer":"학생과","writeDate":"2026.05.29","hit":"6530","attachments":[{"name":"2026년 장애학생 체력증진 프로그램 안내문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=564205&attachNo=164398"},{"name":"2026년 장애학생 체력측정 포스터.png","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=564205&attachNo=164399"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">대구대학교에서&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">년 장애학생 지원 권역별 선도대학 운영 사업</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">」</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">의 일환으로</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">장애학생의&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">건강관리 및 체력 증진 지원을 위한 </span><b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">「</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">장애학생 체력증진 프로그램</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">」</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">을 운영하오니 많은 관심과 참여 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">프로그램 개요</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">프로그램명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">장애학생 체력증진 프로그램</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">운영 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 2026. 6.~10.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">운영 내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">자율 운동 및 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1:1 pt </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">등록비 지원 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">지원 대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">전국 대학 재학 장애학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">휴학생 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">운영 방식</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">매월 참여자 모집 및 선발 진행</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">신청 안내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">신청 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">전월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">15</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">~25</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">일</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">※ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">월 프로그램은 사업 준비 과정으로 인해 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">6. 2.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">까지 신청 </span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">   </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">신청 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">구글폼 또는 전화 신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">붙임 안내문 참조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- 구글폼: https://forms.gle/CMBRkoDdvejPCSHh7&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp;- 전화 및 문의: 대구대학교 장애학생지원센터 053-850-5207</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">문의 사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">대구대학교 장애학생지원센터 </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">☎ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">053-850-5207</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">붙임  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">체력증진 프로그램 안내문 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">부</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 191%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2. </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">프로그램 홍보 포스터 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.  </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">끝</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"14175\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 0,\n\"dv\": 5,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.0\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"9, 1, 1, 5656\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_Unknown_Version\"\n},\n\"dis